<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Boston Scientific view up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Boston Scientific view up.</headline>
<text>
<p>--J.P. Morgan Securities Inc medical technology analyst Michael Weinstein said he raised his earnings per share estimates for Boston Scientific Corp to $2.20 from $2.15 for 1997 and to $2.80 from $2.75 for 1998.</p>
<p>--He said he made the adjustments based on conversations with management.</p>
<p>--Shares in the medical devices maker were up 2-1/4 to 64.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
